After reviewing the several responses that my initial post received here is an update:
..
1) EWDRIVER is the module listed as having executed the last instruction
   before all of the crashs that I have seen in the last week and also in
   the last six months.
..
2) EWDRIVER is listed all 20 of the last instructions in these crashs.
   The order of the instructions and their contents are identical between
   all of these crashs also.
