   Stack Decoder's "a (Exception Frame)" and have assorted PWRK$STREAMOS_V6...
   annotations that follow.  This is evident in only the last week's crash
   dumps.  Searching the sys$errorlog clue files has the same UCB$N_RSADDR
   info but no PWRK$STREAMOS_V6... matchs.
