>I have an AlphaStation 500/266, 2 RZ28 disks, internal RRD45 CD-ROM and an
>additional Tandberg TDC3660 streamer externally attached.  When I got this
>machine about a year ago, it had Digital Unix 3.2D-1 installed.  Trouble with
