for DECwindows!).
  
<insert story here> 
  One while working with a terminal emulator I had a nasty bug crop up
and  it was the emulator.  So I sent a message to it's owner and was
told the original VT100 design was wrong and he fixed it.  As someone
who participated in vt100 design, he was suitably corrected with a
list of  10 pages of emulation errors as compared to
VT100/101/102/103/105 series according to the DEC STANDARD Terminals
