X-Priority: 3 (Normal)
Organization: Salzburger Kredit- und Wechsel-Bank
Reply-To: org@skwb.co.at
Newsgroups: comp.sys.dec


The onboard Tulip 21142-ethernet controller works if you change one line
in the source-code (/usr/src/linux/drivers/net/tulip.c):

-    tp->cur_index = i;
+    tp->cur_index = 0;

Works with Kernel 2.0.29 and 10baseT. The problem is the media-selection
(if you use a different ethernet - ex. 100 MBit you have to change 0 to
the appropriate value). 

Thanx to those who tried to help me (Vladimir, Brian and all the
others).

Gernot
