to give to Power Macintosh users true playable performance of Windows 
95 and DOS games and entertainment titles with full sound support. 
Connectix Virtual PC brings the added advantage of PC compatibility 
to the Macintosh platform," said Gina Clark, Vice President and 
General Manager, Software, Connectix Corporation. 
