> the DECServer. Any further help you could offer me would be excellent. Thank
> you very much. Will Edwards

I've forgotten the earlier part of this thread, so I may be asking
already-answered
questions. SHOW NODE on the VMS node will only tell you about itself,
not the
DECserver. Could you check the following from SHOW NODE:

Incoming and Outgoing connections are "Enabled"
The service(s) reported are "Available"

If the above are as specified, LAT is running and able to accept
connections. If not,
check you issue SET NODE/CONNECTIONS=BOTH and SET NODE/STATE=ON in
LAT$SYSTARTUP.COM.
If it would help, I can forward my LAT$SYSTARTUP.COM with annotations to
explain
what it means - I didn't want to clog up the newsgroup.

